{
  "title": "VPC Endpoint · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "VPC에서 지원되는 AWS 서비스에 비공개 경로로 접근합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Endpoint</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#guide-1\">대표적인 두 가지 연결 방식</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#guide-2\">연결과 권한을 함께 설정하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>58 / 62</span></div><h1>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Endpoint</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>VPC 엔드포인트는 <strong>VPC의 리소스가 인터넷 경로를 사용하지 않고 지원 서비스에 접근하도록 연결하는 구성 요소</strong>입니다. 비공개 서버에서 S3 파일을 읽거나 Secrets Manager를 호출할 때 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p>연결 대상에 따라 게이트웨이 엔드포인트와 인터페이스 엔드포인트 등을 선택합니다. 주소와 연결 방식이 다르므로 먼저 어떤 서비스에 접근하려는지 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"gateway-endpoint\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"interface-endpoint\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"gateway-load-balancer-endpoint\"></span><h2>대표적인 두 가지 연결 방식</h2><p><strong>게이트웨이 엔드포인트:</strong> S3와 DynamoDB 접근에 사용합니다. 서브넷의 라우팅 테이블에 서비스로 향하는 경로를 추가하는 방식입니다.</p><p><strong>인터페이스 엔드포인트:</strong> AWS PrivateLink<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 통해 지원 서비스에 연결합니다. 선택한 서브넷에 사설 IP를 가진 네트워크 인터페이스가 생성되며 보안 그룹을 적용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"resource-endpoint\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"service-network-endpoint\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"tunnel-endpoint\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\"></span><h2>연결과 권한을 함께 설정하기</h2><p>엔드포인트를 만들어도 서비스에 대한 접근 권한이 자동 부여되지는 않습니다. IAM 정책, 서비스의 리소스 정책, 엔드포인트 정책을 함께 확인합니다.</p><p>인터페이스 엔드포인트는 DNS 설정과 보안 그룹이 중요합니다. 필요한 AZ 배치와 비용을 고려하고, 사내망이나 다른 VPC에서의 접근 가능 여부도 엔드포인트 유형에 맞게 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>비공개 서비스 접근</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>VPC의 앱 서버</strong><span>서비스 호출</span></li><li><strong>VPC 엔드포인트</strong><span>전용 접근 경로</span></li><li><strong>AWS 서비스</strong><span>권한을 확인한 뒤 처리</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">네트워크 경로와 서비스 접근 권한은 각각 구성해야 합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>퍼블릭 IP가 없는 EC2에서 S3의 데이터를 읽습니다. 해당 서브넷의 라우팅 테이블에 S3 게이트웨이 엔드포인트를 연결하고, EC2 역할에 필요한 객체 읽기 권한을 부여합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>AWS PrivateLink</strong> — 서비스 제공자의 네트워크 전체를 연결하지 않고 특정 서비스에 사설 연결을 제공하는 기술입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/privatelink/concepts.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS PrivateLink concepts ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q017\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q018\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q018\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q018</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q018/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company creates an ENI with a private IP address in a private subnet to access an AWS service. Which endpoint type is this?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A transit gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q018\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An interface endpoint</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 인터페이스 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a> 기반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 만든다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,3\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q083\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet's route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q010\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q011\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">이전 용어 <b>VPC</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">다음 용어 <b>VPC Peering</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
